    "sections": {
        "description": "<ul>\n<li>Author: <a href=\"https://www.androidbubbles.com/contact\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Fahad Mahmood</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ultimate Order Combination lets you merge multiple WooCommerce orders into a single order while preserving all metadata, customer details, and line items. You can remove all original orders related to combined order. You have the option to move orders to trash or delete orders permanently. Inventory stats will not be affected because of orders combination.</p>\n<h4>How it works?</h4>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HAMuzSm0Jd0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Combine multiple WooCommerce orders into one</li>\n<li>Preserve all order metadata</li>\n<li>Move or delete original orders after combining</li>\n<li>Cron-based automation and rule-based merging</li>\n<li>Supports Gravity Forms product meta</li>\n<li>Compatible with WooCommerce HPOS</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Support</h4>\n<p>For support and detailed documentation, visit the <a href=\"https://www.androidbubbles.com/contact\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">support page</a> or check the <a href=\"http://androidbubble.com/blog/wordpress/plugins/woo-ultimate-order-combination\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">plugin guide</a>.</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This WordPress plugin is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation, either version 2 of the License, or any later version. This WordPress plugin is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details. You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License along with this WordPress plugin. If not, see http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n<li>There will now be a Combine Orders option in the WooCommerce orders list page under bulk actions.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"how%20can%20we%20restore%20combined%20orders%3F\">\nHow can we restore combined orders?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KOWb8-Ku5KY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"what%20are%20the%20trashed%20orders%20and%20how%20can%20we%20restore%20it%3F\">\nWhat are the trashed orders and how can we restore it?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GIyQ38NYnbk?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20to%20move%20selected%20orders%20to%20trash%20after%20combination%3F\">\nHow to move selected orders to trash after combination?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>There are three ways to combine orders.</p>\n<p>1) Orders list &gt; bulk options<br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RMpGLphGp8w?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>2) General Settings &gt; Analyze</p>\n<p>3) Automation Tab</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GzNC6SmprHc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eDhYqO2XieE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>All above methods allow you to optionally move to trash option.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"what%20premium%20version%20is%20about%3F\">\nWhat premium version is about?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bn6wNjdNqyE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20can%20i%20merge%20orders%20in%20the%20basic%20version%3F\">\nHow Can I Merge Orders in the Basic Version?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RDRvBUly2Go?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20does%20it%20work%20with%20orders%20having%20variations%3F\">\nHow does it work with orders having variations?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OZy9F5FKKsY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20this%20compatible%20with%20woocommerce%3F\">\nIs this compatible with WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20we%20split%20orders%20with%20this%20plugin%3F\">\nCan we split orders with this plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20it%20works%3F\">\nHow it works?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Under WooCommerce Menu &gt; Orders List. You have a dropdown for bulk actions, there you will see an option to combine orders. This is the basic feature which is provided for FREE in this plugin. Other methods or options are added or will be added later, can be premium or free. Kindly don&#8217;t misunderstand as it&#8217;s an incomplete plugin. Basic plugin was released with one basic feature to combine orders.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DsxXj-DuBW4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20we%20combine%20orders%20by%20same%20customer%20id%3F\">\nCan we combine orders by same customer id?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, these settings are available in premium version.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GzNC6SmprHc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20we%20combine%20orders%20by%20same%20customer%20email%3F\">\nCan we combine orders by same customer email?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, these settings are available in premium version.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GzNC6SmprHc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20we%20combine%20orders%20by%20the%20same%20phone%20number%20entered%20during%20checkout%3F\">\nCan we combine orders by the same phone number entered during checkout?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, these settings are available in premium version.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GzNC6SmprHc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20we%20combine%20orders%20by%20identical%20billing%20address%3F\">\nCan we combine orders by identical billing address?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, these settings are available in premium version.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GzNC6SmprHc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20we%20combine%20orders%20by%20identical%20shipping%20address%3F\">\nCan we combine orders by identical shipping address?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, these settings are available in premium version.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GzNC6SmprHc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"we%20have%20some%20items%20with%20different%20attributes%20and%20values%2C%20can%20these%20items%20be%20separated%3F\">\nWe have some items with different attributes and values, can these items be separated?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, as per choice these items can be separated. There is a checkbox &#8220;Keep Order Items Separate using Attributes and Values&#8221; in purple section on general settings tab. If this checkbox is On, the plugin will separate items with different attributes and values.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z7uh5enmCv4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"automation%20%7C%20combined%20orders%20%7C%20trashed%20orders\">\nAutomation | Combined Orders | Trashed Orders\n</h4>\n<p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WT7iKybHld8?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"split%20%2F%20combine%20-%20gravity%20forms\">\nSplit / Combine &#8211; Gravity Forms\n</h4>\n<p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NlM72V458L4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added optimized combined+unknown status orders counting with transient caching, improved HPOS/classic orders screen compatibility, and fixed WooCommerce order status query handling. [18/05/2026][Thanks to Bianca Sanderson]</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested orders combination functionality with full HPOS compatibility. Fixed the combination rule for billing address including email and phone number. [11/05/2026][Thanks to Dennis Vogt from Germany]</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Full HPOS compatibility with wc_get_orders(), fixed date filtering, status prefix removal, removed invalid get_shipping_email(), improved meta query structure, translation loading fix for WP 6.7+. [08/05/2026][Thanks to Dennis Vogt from Germany]</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed PHP 8.1 deprecated parameter warnings in stock filter functions. [26/10/2025][Thanks to Benjamin Belaga]</li>\n<li>Fixed WooCommerce Analytics fatal error (undefined get_report_customer_id) with safe try/catch handling.</li>\n<li>Fixed display issue showing &#8220;0 orders removed&#8221; after combination.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Merge and manage WooCommerce orders with ease.",
    "description": "<ul>\n<li>Author: <a href=\"https://www.androidbubbles.com/contact\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Fahad Mahmood</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ultimate Order Combination lets you merge multiple WooCommerce orders into a single order while preserving all metadata, customer details, and line items. You can remove all original orders related to combined order. You have the option to move orders to trash or delete orders permanently. Inventory stats will not be affected because of orders combination.</p>\n<h4>How it works?</h4>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HAMuzSm0Jd0?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Combine multiple WooCommerce orders into one</li>\n<li>Preserve all order metadata</li>\n<li>Move or delete original orders after combining</li>\n<li>Cron-based automation and rule-based merging</li>\n<li>Supports Gravity Forms product meta</li>\n<li>Compatible with WooCommerce HPOS</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Support</h4>\n<p>For support and detailed documentation, visit the <a href=\"https://www.androidbubbles.com/contact\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">support page</a> or check the <a href=\"http://androidbubble.com/blog/wordpress/plugins/woo-ultimate-order-combination\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">plugin guide</a>.</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This WordPress plugin is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation, either version 2 of the License, or any later version. This WordPress plugin is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details. You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License along with this WordPress plugin. If not, see http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html.</p>\n",
